== Notes ==
* Once applied to infused gear, Agony Infusions can be removed via:
** {{item icon|Infusion Extraction Device}}
** {{item icon|Upgrade Extractor}}
** Alternatively, you can replace existing infusions with a new one, destroying the old one.
*** Doing this on [[legendary equipment]] will instead place the old infusion in your inventory and the new infusion will be applied.

